This paper is clearly above the borderline. It has solid empirical contributions with a genuinely novel finding (attention sink elimination via post-SDPA gating), comprehensive ablations, and practical significance. Its main weaknesses are the over-framing of non-linearity as co-equal with sparsity and the confounded NS-sigmoid ablation. These are real but don't invalidate the core empirical findings. Compared to Hyper-Connections (6.25), this paper has a more novel finding and better ablations. Compared to StreamingLLM (7.5), this paper provides more mechanistic analysis but is less clean in its causal story. I place this between those anchors.

